{"lines":[{"y":0.06183489899447403,"h":0.015865085673882784,"w":0.052410135269165048,"c":1,"t":"Test 1","x":0.087981783494210403},{"x":0.088189489155473186,"c":1,"y":0.10748065292184683,"t":"But sugar production was never just a matter of agriculture. It also involved the extraction,","w":0.71116907755533854,"h":0.020449558949453772},{"x":0.086505183033374969,"y":0.12790697646194293,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"t":"close to the place of harvest, of sucrose from the sugar plant, a process which required","w":0.674740498860677},{"x":0.088126185366109319,"t":"machinery powered by humans, animals, wind or steam. Further processes involved","h":0.023414801350000292,"w":0.65074544270833345,"y":0.14217010797155116,"c":1},{"w":0.69743611653645832,"x":0.088145881819442787,"h":0.023347890652335557,"t":"boiling (from the 19th century, this often involved vacuum systems) and the separation of","y":0.16095924413572438,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020104537066919503,"x":0.086464204799862429,"t":"sugar from other materials in a process known as refinement. From very early on, sugar","y":0.18053983879218816,"w":0.68520421346028648},{"x":0.086462191314419387,"y":0.19850437684432398,"h":0.021872542470046996,"w":0.72501032511393237,"c":1,"t":"production was an energy-intensive industrial process, mostly taking place in the countryside"},{"w":0.72327184041341142,"h":0.020320961740652566,"y":0.21786842066206158,"t":"and in refineries in centres of consumption, both small and large. The growth of the industry","x":0.088188154051071124,"c":1},{"y":0.23523277999390746,"w":0.71117223103841143,"c":1,"t":"entailed a very rapid diffusion of ideas and techniques from one country to another. Cuba,","x":0.088190918663679077,"h":0.020610725237323879},{"y":0.25577326821773905,"x":0.086505184920231959,"w":0.72145329793294266,"h":0.017494751574527734,"c":1,"t":"for example, developed an extraordinarily dense system of railways to transport workers and"},{"c":1,"w":0.69905303955078124,"h":0.019927752943953214,"x":0.088185607561882484,"y":0.27232972111956055,"t":"cane, as well as steam-powered sugar factories. Particular varieties of cane sugar and beet"},{"t":"sugar spread very rapidly across the world, in accordance with local needs and demands.","c":1,"w":0.6885813395182292,"x":0.088235281730478621,"y":0.29215116281815967,"h":0.018905520188883473},{"t":"Where once only tiny quantities of sugar could be produced, now new techniques, varieties,","w":0.71280278523763019,"y":0.32848837180810353,"h":0.017557814206336286,"x":0.088235285622650109,"c":1},{"y":0.34738372064809031,"w":0.66262975056966134,"c":1,"x":0.088235297645381031,"h":0.017556797131697888,"t":"fertilisers, irrigation systems and much more have turned gleaming white sugar into a"},{"h":0.020414060108139398,"c":1,"t":"ubiquitous chemical. Over the same time, there has been a massive increase in consumption.","x":0.088181573350817929,"y":0.36424729811252354,"w":0.71809000651041666},{"h":0.017608671275112897,"t":"Once regarded as a luxury, sugar came to be promoted as a valuable source of energy. But as","x":0.088235288786542201,"c":1,"y":0.38372092994749329,"w":0.72145329793294277},{"y":0.40006917986894297,"h":0.021332191536691858,"t":"the consumption of sugar has increased, so has the harm it does, whether to people's teeth","w":0.70429723103841146,"x":0.088159206499789394,"c":1},{"y":0.42005813924582891,"w":0.72145329793294277,"c":1,"h":0.01744186102384615,"t":"or weight. In the face of appalling obstruction from the sugar industry to attempts to reduce","x":0.088235288719995322},{"y":0.43736878915803967,"t":"consumption, some countries have been forced to tax sugar in order to bring that about. The","x":0.088235316754636042,"w":0.72145324707031255,"h":0.019026559411937094,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.70588231404622392,"x":0.088235320035711412,"y":0.45626312096784905,"t":"sugar industry has a history of attacking its critics and, when it comes to obesity, of trying","h":0.019027576486575493},{"y":0.47375787260378033,"t":"to blame fats, and lack of exercise and self-control. And the recent past has seen worrying","x":0.088235298730721945,"w":0.6989619445800781,"h":0.018974685268522196,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.088235296741565231,"t":"new developments in mass sweetening. High-fructose corn syrup made from maize using an","w":0.71626296997070305,"h":0.018975702343160594,"y":0.49265220459011183},{"c":1,"t":"enzymatic process invented in Japan in the 1960s has a similar number of calories to table","w":0.69919219970703128,"x":0.08810159120875416,"y":0.50740696573119415,"h":0.023422905913260239},{"t":"sugar but is far cheaper to produce. It is now widely consumed, having been adopted in the","h":0.020377317285771301,"c":1,"w":0.70761245727539057,"y":0.52904128768656289,"x":0.088235293827379255},{"h":0.017525265815793611,"x":0.088235302040540947,"y":0.54933519957752486,"t":"making of soft drinks and a large number of processed foods, and is regarded as a leading","c":1,"w":0.70242212931315096},{"x":0.088051992812301166,"t":"cause of obesity.","h":0.017330105610040558,"w":0.13192398071289063,"y":0.56717004415943129,"c":1},{"x":0.089965391273438416,"w":0.69031143188476562,"h":0.01891569160263884,"t":"This is a wonderfully rich book, a model of global history, the history of production and","c":1,"y":0.60319767444629491},{"x":0.088235302047523015,"y":0.62209302328392047,"c":1,"h":0.018914674528000552,"t":"the history of capitalism. Bosma avoids outbursts of emotion, celebratory or critical, even","w":0.70242212931315096},{"x":0.088235299627903691,"h":0.019021474038745323,"w":0.70069203694661464,"c":1,"t":"if they might have made his analysis of the multiple tragedies involving sugar all the more","y":0.638081395143686},{"h":0.019403752619941539,"x":0.089892575047807011,"y":0.65794750881663255,"c":1,"t":"powerful. He shows that we could always have done without sugar and that today we have","w":0.70081741333007808},{"y":0.67732558111192764,"t":"many alternative sources of sweetness. Yet many of the poorest people in the world still","w":0.67820068359374996,"c":1,"h":0.017565951470814856,"x":0.089965402130862918},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"depend on it to make a living.","w":0.23356402079264321,"y":0.69622093030268839,"c":1,"x":0.089965394342060842},{"t":"26","w":0.022491348584493004,"x":0.089965398294258675,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"y":0.96075581401224364}],"h":2857,"w":2400}